<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo doubles bond to 200 mln DEM.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo doubles bond to 200 mln DEM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured bond has been increased to 200 million marks from 100 million marks, sole lead Sal. Oppenheim jr &amp; Cie KgaA said on Friday.</p>
<p>All other terms and conditions remained the same on the deal</p>
<p>which was launched Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.90	MATURITY   *20.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FEES   UNDISCLOSED   LISTING    HANNOVER  DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR ON 20.DEC.96 AFTER WHICH THE COUPON</p>
<p>		STEPS UP TO 5.00 PERCENT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
